# URL patterns lychee skips when checking links in doc/, llms.txt and *.md.
# Every line is a REGULAR EXPRESSION, not a glob.
#
# Add a host here only when it is auth-walled, rate-limited, or a placeholder in
# a code sample. Real rot belongs in the report, not in this file.

# GitHub auth wall: the login redirect answers with a 404 to an unauthenticated
# CI runner.
^https://github\.com/login

# A private vulnerability report needs a signed-in session.
^https://github\.com/anilcancakir/magic-starter-laravel/security/advisories/new

# Placeholder hosts inside example code.
^https?://([a-z0-9-]+\.)*example\.com
^https?://localhost
^https?://127\.0\.0\.1

# 2026-11-16: the docs site serves doc/ only from a release tag, so the landing
# and every docs page answer 404 until the first tag (1.0.0) is synced. Remove
# this line once https://anilcancakir.com/magic-starter-laravel answers 200.
^https://anilcancakir\.com/magic-starter-laravel

# 2026-11-16: Packagist has no anilcancakir/magic-starter-laravel package until
# the first release is submitted. Remove this line once the package page answers
# 200.
^https://packagist\.org/packages/anilcancakir/magic-starter-laravel
